H9XASH ref_gl.dll -- built from patched source by TSM\xash3d-h9-patches\xash.bat

The OpenGL renderer. The webassembly patch's renderer part: MSR's bloom and scene MSAA (r_bloom, r_scene_msaa) and gl2_shim fixes, plus engine-h9-suddendeath.patch (movevars fog on a plain game) and engine-h9-xray.patch (renderfx 64: sudden death's glow shells, drawn through walls).

Upstream: FWGS master e8d773ea. Built: branch h9 at 7129989e, plus an uncommitted change to ref/gl/gl_studio.c (a one-off install, not from a commit).
Below is the whole source change, paths from the xash3d-fwgs root; "git apply" replays it on a clone.
It is taken from the working tree, so uncommitted work is in it.

